    "detailed_description": "A space theme of a small casual shooting game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are two perspectives, the character and the ship<br />\r\nThe world is full of monsters and enemies<br />\r\nThe player can control the character/ship, dodge or shoot enemies, and replenish energy and various items consumed by collecting<br />\r\nCollect discarded parts and items to enhance character abilities<br />\r\nBullets have 5 levels, but the energy cost also increases with the level of the bullet<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story:<br />\r\nDue to the failure of the mission, the abandoned spaceship wandering in the deserted universe crash-lands on the planet of Pai. The player will control and lead the protagonist to face the monster enemies in the game and find a way to escape from Pai, looking for the hope of survival.",
